[h2] Character Overview [/h2] 
The Annoying Dog is a lightweight, rushdown, glass-cannon type of fighter! They love to run amok and be kind of... annoying...

[h1] Special Moves [/h1] 
[list]
    [*][b]NEUTRAL SPECIAL[/b] - A cute little bark. Charge the move to fire a [[BIG]] little bark.
    [*][b]FORWARD SPECIAL[/b] - The last thing you see before you die. The Annoying Dog in a toy car. Run over opponents and turn around to combo them further into... the car again... and again.
    [*][b]UP SPECIAL[/b] - The Bird That Carries You Over A Deceptively Ungrabbable Ledge 
    [*][b]DOWN SPECIAL[/b] - This dog is a BOMB. Nothing really more to say, they are a bomb and you should move.
[/list] 

[h1] Dog Moves [/h1] 
[list]
    [*][b]FORWARD STRONG[/b] - Summon a full suit of Greater Armor! Hold charge to travel further!
    [*][b]UP STRONG[/b] - DOG GAMBLING. Although most of the time a bone will be dug out of the ground, there's really all kinds of stuff down there! Bones, Plushies, More Bones, A Framed Photograph of Papyrus, and even... The Legendary Artifact...
    [*][b]DOWN TILT[/b] - Temmie is here too
    [*][b]TAUNT(s)[/b] - There's many taunts! You can bluh... or press Taunt while holding Down to do a dance! Or even taunt while doing certain moves to play some sounds... hmm... I wonder what else is there...
    [*][b]DOG STRONG[/b] - They are.
[/list] 


